<item><title>官方西班牙裔传统晚会将全球领袖聚集在华盛顿特区，扩大西班牙裔社区的声音</title><link>https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/guan-fang-xi-ban-ya-yi-chuan-tong-wan-hui-jiang-quan-qiu-ling-xiu-ju-ji-zai-hua-sheng-dun-te-qu-kuo-da-xi-ban-ya-yi-she-qu-de-sheng-yin--866331778.html</link><guid>https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/guan-fang-xi-ban-ya-yi-chuan-tong-wan-hui-jiang-quan-qiu-ling-xiu-ju-ji-zai-hua-sheng-dun-te-qu-kuo-da-xi-ban-ya-yi-she-qu-de-sheng-yin--866331778.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:02:00 +0000</pubDate><description><![CDATA[<p>这场久负盛名的庆祝活动由拉丁裔华尔街和西班牙裔传统晚会委员会组织，欢迎阿根廷总统哈维尔•米莱作为荣誉嘉宾，接受了白宫的正式问候，并吸引了56家经认证的媒体。 华盛顿2026年10月16日 /美通社/ -- 拉丁裔华尔街和西班牙裔传统晚会委员会于10月14日在华盛顿特区历史悠久的安德鲁•梅隆礼堂举办了官方西班牙裔传统晚会，其使命是提升西班牙裔的声音，庆祝拉丁裔的成就，为更大的代表性和机会创造有影响力的平台。 这次享有盛誉的聚会汇集了国际领导人、美国政府高级官员、外交官、有影响力的企业家和知名人士，庆祝活动重点介绍了拉美裔领导层和社区对美国的贡献。...</p>]]></description><media:content url="https://mmx.prnewswire.com/media/MS2014851/Latino-Wallstreet-Hispanic-Heritage-Gala-Javier-Milei-Gabriela-Berrospi-Eduardo-Bolsonaro-Photo.jpg?id=OA3023235&amp;p=original" type="image/jpeg" width="144"><media:text type="html"><![CDATA[<p><a href='https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/guan-fang-xi-ban-ya-yi-chuan-tong-wan-hui-jiang-quan-qiu-ling-xiu-ju-ji-zai-hua-sheng-dun-te-qu-kuo-da-xi-ban-ya-yi-she-qu-de-sheng-yin--866331778.html'><img src='https://mmx.prnewswire.com/media/MS2014851/Latino-Wallstreet-Hispanic-Heritage-Gala-Javier-Milei-Gabriela-Berrospi-Eduardo-Bolsonaro-Photo.jpg?id=OA3023235&p=original' align='left'  width='144' alt='photo' title='' border='0'/><a></p><br clear='all'/>]]></media:text><media:credit role="publishing company">PRNewswire</media:credit></media:content><prn:industry><![CDATA[Banking & Financial Services]]></prn:industry><prn:industry><![CDATA[FIN]]></prn:industry><prn:subject><![CDATA[Awards]]></prn:subject><prn:subject><![CDATA[Aboriginal, First Nations & Native American]]></prn:subject><prn:subject><![CDATA[African American ]]></prn:subject><prn:subject><![CDATA[Asian American]]></prn: